  "description": "Fast, deterministic, offline-capable first-pass security aid for MCP servers and Agent Skill authors. 47 security rules aligned with OWASP Agentic AI Top 10 (ASI) and OWASP Agentic Skills Top 10 (AST). v3.0 adds prompt/resource/instructions injection coverage, skill forensics (SHA256SUMS, file artefacts), homoglyph and description-overlap detection, fetch-to-exec pipeline taint, opt-in OSV dependency lookups, error-channel injection, server-source sink analysis, A2A agent card evaluation, policy presets, a versioned scoring rubric (--rubric), markdown-aware segmentation for skill rules, and discovery across Claude Code, Gemini CLI, OpenCode, VS Code/Copilot and Amazon Q configurations.",
